# TOEFL Vocabulary Day55

| 단어 | 의미 | 예문 |
|---|---|---|
| migrate | 이동하다, 이주하다 | Many birds migrate during winter. |
| adapt | 적응하다 | Animals adapt to changing environments. |
| reproduce | 번식하다, 재생산하다 | Some species reproduce rapidly. |
| survive | 생존하다 | Only a few organisms survived. |
| consume | 소비하다, 먹다 | The animals consume various plants. |
| compete | 경쟁하다 | Species compete for limited resources. |
| predator | 포식자 | The predator hunts smaller animals. |
| resource | 자원 | Water is an important natural resource. |

### 암기 포인트

- migrate seasonally: 계절에 따라 이동하다
- adapt to the environment: 환경에 적응하다
- reproduce rapidly: 빠르게 번식하다
- consume energy: 에너지를 소비하다
- compete for resources: 자원을 두고 경쟁하다
- natural resource: 천연자원
